ponent inputs from full movie processing.\n2. Review the evidence/report as a bounded standalone contribution. Correction to overly broad earlier wording: useful evidence-only documentation can be retained on main after review, provided doing so does not import stale production code or relabel historical runs as current.\n3. For continued implementation, use #29's coherent integration branch and #33's actual-kernel witnesses. Re-run complete pixels/headers/metadata and known-motion controls on the chosen candidate.\n4. Use paired end-to-end timing and measured memory on the same Apple host; two exploratory runs are not a stable speedup. Keep setup, CPU portions and synchronization in the cost.\n\n#34 owns full real-data coverage; #35 the bounded local/reconstruction decision. This experiment does not block native CUDA upstream work under #66. No new default, gate change or merge approval is implied.","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/issues/comments/5860195625/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.gith